# Conclusion

Effective project closure ensures that project outcomes continue creating value after the project team has completed their work.

Through structured handover, documentation, lessons learned, and operational transition, the Emergency Department Patient Flow Transformation project achieves sustainable improvements for patients, healthcare professionals, and the organisation.
